@startuml
[*] --> Inserted : Card inserted
Inserted --> PIN entered : User enters PIN
PIN entered --> PIN verified : System verifies PIN against stored information
alt Successful PIN verification
  PIN verified --> Options provided : Provide options to user
  Options provided --> Withdrawal processed : User selects withdrawal option and approves request
  Withdrawal processed --> Cash dispensed : System processes withdrawal request and dispenses cash
  Cash dispensed --> Receipt printed : Cash dispensing completed, printing receipt for transaction
  Receipt printed --> Card returned : Return user's card
  alt Cash dispensing completed
    Card returned --> Reset : System resets itself after brief moment
  end
else
  PIN verified --> Inserted : Invalid PIN, prompt user to enter PIN again
end

[*] --> Reset : System is ready for next user
@enduml
